fix  mesh all mesh/surface file                   mesh.stl    &
                           type                   2           &
                           element_exclusion_list read exlist &
                           curvature_tolerant     yes

fix  case all wall/gran    model                  hertz       &
                           tangential             history     &
                           mesh                               &
                           n_meshes               1 meshes mesh

fix  ypln all wall/gran    model                  hertz       &
                           tangential             history     &
                           primitive                          &
                           type                   2           &
                           yplane                 0

